==Trivia==
*{{WP|Griffin|Gryphons}} are mythical creatures said to have the body, tail, and back legs of a lion, and the head and wings of an eagle - though rather than an eagle, this gryphon appears to be based on a {{WP|European herring gull|herring gull}}.
* A gryphon NPC was present in the [[RuneScape:Cache|cache]] of the [[August 2025 Sailing Stress Test]], but was not accessible and had the same model as a [[sandcrab]].
* [[Grimgnash]], an NPC encountered during the [[Grim Tales]] quest, is a griffin. It is unknown what connection there may be between griffins like Grimgnash and gryphons like those found on the Great Conch.

